    <x:String x:Key="Node_Patch_FormatHint">Inspects staged content, not the extension. Structure checks currently cover JSON, XML, explicit INI, ELF, sparse and vbmeta. Other recognized formats report signature only. This does not verify hashes, signatures, filesystem consistency or device compatibility.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Node_PatchFormat_Unknown">No supported content signature or configuration structure found</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Node_PatchFormat_SignatureOnly">Content signature found; structure has not been validated</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Node_PatchFormat_Configuration">Configuration parsed within the size, depth and complexity limits</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Node_PatchFormat_ElfTables">ELF header and metadata table ranges checked; execution and dynamic linking not verified</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Node_PatchFormat_SparseChunks">Sparse header, chunk ranges and block totals checked; CRC not verified</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Node_PatchFormat_AvbDescriptors">VBMeta metadata and descriptor ranges checked; signature and trust chain not verified</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Node_PatchFormat_RejectedStructure">Malformed, truncated, unsupported or over-limit structure; cannot satisfy the precondition</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Node_Choice_Unknown">Unknown</x:String>
